{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"彌迦書","commonName":"彌迦書","title":"彌迦書","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"7653aa64f11ed5e86b64f5806ce4393d656010dca6eac643843bbaa97a4000ce","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的將來"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"在末後的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華殿所在的山必聳立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高過群山，超過萬嶺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬民都要湧向它。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國都必來，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「來吧，讓我們登耶和華的山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去雅各之上帝的殿。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必教導我們行祂的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我們走祂的路。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為訓誨必出於錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的話語必來自耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必在列邦施行審判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為遠方的強國平息紛爭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必把刀劍打成犁頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將矛槍打成鐮刀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"國與國不再刀兵相見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們也不再學習戰事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人都安然坐在自己的葡萄樹和無花果樹下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再擔驚受怕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是萬軍之耶和華親口說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬民都遵從自己神明的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我們要永遠遵從我們的上帝耶和華的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「到那日，我要聚集瘸腿的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"招聚被擄的和被我懲罰的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使瘸腿的成為餘民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓被擄的成為強國。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華要在錫安山做王治理他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從那時直到永遠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「你這羊群的瞭望塔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女錫安的堅壘啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從前的國權必得恢復，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女耶路撒冷的王位必歸你。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"現在你為何大聲哭喊？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因為你沒有王嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你的謀士都死了嗎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致你像分娩的婦人一樣痛苦不堪？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女錫安啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要像分娩的婦人一樣輾轉呻吟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你現在要離開這城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在荒野，被擄到巴比倫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裡，你將得到解救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那裡，耶和華必從敵人手中救贖你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"現在許多國家一起來攻擊你，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「願錫安遭蹂躪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們要看著錫安被毀滅。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻不知道耶和華的心意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不明白祂的計劃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂聚集他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像把禾捆堆積在麥場一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「少女錫安啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起來打穀吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要給你鐵角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要給你銅蹄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要打碎列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將他們的不義之財獻給耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他們的財富獻給普天下的主。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}